{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047890/extras/234cf8f3997ea7dffdb0a063351e8ab8.poster.avif?t=1773305280\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047890/extras/234cf8f3997ea7dffdb0a063351e8ab8.webm?t=1773305280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Digging Out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digging Out</strong> is a cooperative digging and heist game for up to 8 players.  <br>Plan your tunnel, dig through realistic voxel terrain, and reach the vault before anyone else does. Every meter counts\u00a0 your tools and teamwork decide if you make it out rich\u2026 or buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No guns. No guards. Just dirt, steel, and the sound of your drill echoing underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047890/extras/38a3a2018456c4e6740b71658a51531d.poster.avif?t=1773305280\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047890/extras/38a3a2018456c4e6740b71658a51531d.webm?t=1773305280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047890/extras/38a3a2018456c4e6740b71658a51531d.mp4?t=1773305280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Heist:</strong> Up to 8 players can join forces to dig their way into the ultimate score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Voxel Digging:</strong> Every block you remove shapes your path toward the vault.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Tools:</strong> Shovels, pickaxes, jackhammers, and dynamite : upgrade and customize your loadout to dig faster and smarter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosives &amp; Gear:</strong> Use dynamite, drills, and other gadgets to breach the toughest layers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outfits &amp; Style:</strong> Unlock new outfits and accessories to stand out in the crew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047890/extras/f3b989d07333a63297ac8999806f2697.poster.avif?t=1773305280\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047890/extras/f3b989d07333a63297ac8999806f2697.webm?t=1773305280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig your perfect tunnel, and <strong>rob the bank</strong>. <br>Every dig is different. Every explosion changes the terrain. <br>Can your crew make the perfect heist and get away clean?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047890?t=1773305280","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047890/93cd920f66f51340945656e8da6800f2798e04ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773305280","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047890/d4119ef4b3220ff816c2fec00fea03ae48fca1ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773305280","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047890/d4119ef4b3220ff816c2fec00fea03ae48fca1ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773305280","categories":[{"description"